{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hechang-e-9c9e70b9dda20f33aeba","title":"裴绰黄门侍郎早卒赠长水校尉","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-9c9e70b9dda20f33aeba","label":"裴注·传补叙及晋诸公赞","text":"裴绰黄门侍郎早卒赠长水校尉","evidence":["hechang-q-b1823d123cc9227e3898"]}],"participants":[{"person":"hechang-p-a246c93492e701","role":"任官去世追赠","evidence":["hechang-q-b1823d123cc9227e3898"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-b1823d123cc9227e3898"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-b1823d123cc9227e3898","order":4848}],"persons":[{"id":"hechang-p-a246c93492e701","name":"裴绰","evidence":["hechang-q-b1823d123cc9227e3898","hechang-q-9ea4395441ceb43197c3"],"facts":[{"id":"hechang-f-385e8006a7272d91eca9","text":"字季舒，裴徽之子。","evidence":["hechang-q-9ea4395441ceb43197c3"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-9ea4395441ceb43197c3","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-7511aa5f4df4e3a44fe9","layer":"pei","quote":"潜少弟徽，字文季。冀州刺史。有高才远度，善言玄妙。事见荀粲、傅嘏、王弼、管辂诸传。徽长子黎，字伯宗。一名演。游击将军。次康，字仲豫。太子左卫率。次楷，字叔则。侍中、中书令、光禄大夫，开府。次绰，字季舒。黄门侍郎，早卒，追赠长水校尉。康、楷、绰皆为名士，而楷才望最重。《晋诸公赞》曰：“康有弘量；绰以明达为称；楷少与琅邪王戎俱为掾，发名，钟会致之大将军司马文王曰：‘裴楷清通，王戎简要。’文王即辟为掾，进历显位。”谢鲲为《乐广传》，称楷“俊朗有识具，当时独步”。","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文，待主审复核）","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":382,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":0,"end":230,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-b1823d123cc9227e3898","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-7511aa5f4df4e3a44fe9","layer":"pei","quote":"次绰，字季舒。黄门侍郎，早卒，追赠长水校尉。","attribution":"裴注·传补叙及晋诸公赞","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":382,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":94,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
